e":"2023-10-25T20:25:00","session_id":"session_26","session_index":26,"source_sha256":"a17b4f54f157b986f21df6986d21ce9714b7fb79ec13b445564ede63da484dcc","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":1},{"dia_id":"D26:3","global_turn_index":458,"locator":"[S26T3]","raw_turn_sha256":"fe45878bd84eaf33303fc8df61a3466b8d3f9aba50e7e0059e9bb35af97b2c5d","rendered_turn_sha256":"ce74130c6f859ab8100a8fda2bab30a2169c0aac5e80d5ebf110f8b4d668728b","session_date":"2023-10-25","session_datetime":"2023-10-25T20:25:00","session_id":"session_26","session_index":26,"source_sha256":"0c7ea61ab88bf9a8d4f8a51e1d1b783e2914d46e97d9bc1a4f66c5718902e3e1","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":3},{"dia_id":"D27:5","global_turn_index":475,"locator":"[S27T5]","raw_turn_sha256":"1df17f04176559c980f7fbb6c610b58d33711c57016c037d40b2000fd6991de8","rendered_turn_sha256":"26d3e4b7d8dc2fdd46520e4801311fb32f3b0e5179477ba7d20538169b02f6c1","session_date":"2023-10-29","session_datetime":"2023-10-29T10:49:00","session_id":"session_27","session_index":27,"source_sha256":"5ccfe315ae15db342cd5b23e2ba8e1373dfa915337a96bbc461e2f91fe864fc4","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":5},{"dia_id":"D27:7","global_turn_index":477,"locator":"[S27T7]","raw_turn_sha256":"744ed2e8c379db525c2e481ea0901f92cecce1b21ab97449517e12f7c1869adc","rendered_turn_sha256":"51aeeab0e7b91e53e5fdb78abd7d2abe13a2bfcd042f8bb1c8231bc2322a2a8b","session_date":"2023-10-29","session_datetime":"2023-10-29T10:49:00","session_id":"session_27","session_index":27,"source_sha256":"30c34ece33a52fae451414d1a9eba944d5f82b36c8917c735160ae684b63a1a0","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":7}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s3","store_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- As of 2023-05-31, the Boston visit is part of the Frank Ocean tour: \"Cool, can't wait for the tour with Frank!\" — he's \"buzzing to perform in Boston and see what it's like\" and \"Gonna be great playing for folks from home\" (calling Boston's folks \"from home\" suggests it is where he's from, though not stated outright). He asked Dave what he thinks of the music scene there; Dave: it's \"awesome — Tons of talented musicians and cool places to play,\" and he'll be there to cheer Calvin on (details in /memories/dave.md > ## Boston) [S7T15][S7T16].\n- On 2023-06-09, said he has never been to Boston before but has heard the parks are amazing — \"can't wait to visit next month\" (i.e., July 2023); he wants to take walks in the Boston parks to experience their serenity and recharge, and asked Dave what cool things he remembers about them; shared a photo of a tree with pink flowers (likely from the album session); Dave's recollections of the Boston parks are in /memories/dave.md > ## Boston [S8T5][S8T7].\n- As of 2023-08-22, said his tour ends soon and he's heading to Boston, and proposed meeting up with Dave then — \"Maybe we can meet up then!\" (renewing the earlier plan to meet in Boston, see above); Dave: \"Fill me in on the details when you have them and let's meet up when you're here. Can't wait to hear all about everything!\" (Note: the 2023-08-14 update described the Frank Ocean tour as already having ended with the Tokyo show, so this \"tour ends soon\" may be a continuation or a new tour — unconfirmed) [S15T10][S15T11].\n- On 2023-09-02, told Dave he booked a flight to Boston \"last week\" (~2023-08-26 through 09-01) and is \"so excited\" about the upcoming Boston trip, sharing a photo of a book with a boarding pass on it — \"See you soon, buddy!\"; he'll let Dave know when he's in Boston, and Dave told him to let him know when he's free so they can catch up in Boston (continuing the plan to meet up in Boston, see above) [S17T6][S17T7][S17T8]. The chat closed with Dave: \"Looking forward to seeing you! Have a safe trip, see ya!\"; Calvin thanked Dave, reciprocated the safe-trip wishes (\"Gotta stay safe on the trip\"), said \"Can't wait to see you there!\", and promised he will contact Dave when he arrives [S17T9][S17T10].\n- On 2023-09-13, re-pledged the plan to let Dave know when he's in Boston — \"I'll let you know when I'm in Boston\" — and accepted Dave's offer to check out his garage and its cool cars (Dave shared a photo of the garage — a car in a garage with a Coca-Cola sign — \"looks stunning!\"), saying it would be fun and might give him ideas for future projects (details in ## Relationships; Dave's side in /memories/dave.md > ## Boston) [S18T11][S18T12].\n- On 2023-10-04, was in Boston: he told Dave he had met with artists there the day before (2023-10-03) to plan a music collaboration (continuation of the planned Boston visit from his late-2023-08/early-2023-09 flight booking above; details in ## Music) [S21T1].\n- On 2023-10-25, told Dave that the day before (2023-10-24) he had a great time sightseeing in Boston with a high school friend — \"really fun and eye-opening\"; he found Boston \"a wonderful experience\" with \"awesome architecture and a really cool history,\" and said it was \"so peaceful\" — following Dave's advice (continuation of his late-2023-08/early-2023-09 Boston visit, see above; details in ## Relationships) [S26T1][S26T3].\n- On 2023-10-29, while looking at Dave's Boston photos (the sunset-over-the-skyline photo and a close-up of the clock tower, see the 2023-10-29 entry in ## Music and the Photography section of /memories/dave.md), Calvin recognized the clock tower and said he was in Boston a few years back — \"it's such a beautiful city.\" (a second, separate Boston visit, in addition to his late-2023-08/early-2023-09 visit above; \"a few years back\" — exact date not given) [S27T5][S27T7].","text_sha256":"d1c00b9928f0898c09b259f17d9cb7149506aa36b68b007273da51bf09f32646","timestamp":null},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D3:9"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":72,"line_start":72,"source_locators":["[S3T9]"],"text_sha256":"a9b417535342c0ed28b7099abc42ad1d3cd09