in","turn_index":24}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s3","store_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- Plans to take Calvin to his favorite spots in the city for food; Calvin proposed grabbing a bite together, and Dave agreed enthusiastically [S3T15][S3T16].\n- Closed the 2023-04-20 conversation looking forward to showing Calvin \"the amazing music and food\" in Boston, saying \"See you soon!\" [S3T18].\n- Also plans to show Calvin some cars when he comes to Boston (see ## Classic cars) [S3T12].\n- On 2023-05-31, said Boston's music scene is \"awesome — Tons of talented musicians and cool places to play\"; Calvin is \"buzzing\" to perform there, and Dave says it \"will be a blast\" and that he'll be there to cheer Calvin on. Calvin's Boston show is now a stop on the Frank Ocean tour — details in the Boston trip section of /memories/calvin.md [S7T15][S7T16].\n- As of 2023-06-09, says the Boston parks are \"awesome, especially in spring\" — \"it's so serene when you're walking around\" — and went for a stroll in one on 2023-06-02 (last Friday), which was \"amazing ... magical\"; he bet Calvin will love it [S8T6].\n- On 2023-08-22, Calvin said his tour ends soon and he's heading to Boston, proposing they meet up then (renewing the plan for Dave to show Calvin around, see above); Dave: \"Sounds great! Fill me in on the details when you have them and let's meet up when you're here. Can't wait to hear all about everything!\" (Calvin's side in the Boston trip section of /memories/calvin.md) [S15T10][S15T11].\n- On 2023-09-13, when Calvin got excited about his tour spots, said live music is the best, was sure Calvin would have a blast on tour and make awesome memories, and offered to show Calvin around his garage and its cool cars — \"If you ever want to check out my garage and see some cool cars, I'd love to show you around. Keep rockin'!\" (renewing his long-standing offer to show Calvin some cars when he comes to Boston, see ## Classic cars); shared a photo of his garage (a car in a garage with a Coca-Cola sign) — \"Check out pic of my garage, it looks stunning!\" — and said \"Can't wait for your visit!\"; Calvin accepted the offer (\"I'll definitely take you up on that offer\") and re-pledged to let Dave know when he's in Boston (Calvin's side in the Boston trip section of /memories/calvin.md) [S18T10][S18T11][S18T12].\n- On 2023-11-17, when Calvin announced he's accepted an invitation to perform at an upcoming show in Boston (details in the Music section of this file and in ## Music of /memories/calvin.md), said \"Wow, Calvin! That's amazing news! Congratulations on both the gala attendance and the upcoming performance. I can't wait to hear all about it and maybe even catch one of your shows in Boston. Let me know when you're free to catch up. Cheers to your musical journey!\"; Calvin: \"Thanks, Dave! I'll catch you when I'm in Boston. Cheers!\" — and the chat closed with mutual goodbyes — Dave: \"Looking forward to seeing you. Stay safe, talk to you soon!\" and Calvin: \"Thanks! You too. Talk to you later!\" [S30T20][S30T21][S30T22][S30T23][S30T24].","text_sha256":"cbc55e6cff9dc5b96db41454bbabc6e244283c29a2304ebdd3c107a46d7a9df7","timestamp":null}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","pre_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":604,"filesystem_tool_calls":0,"model_calls":4,"orchestration_calls":4,"prompt_tokens":28771,"provider_request_attempts":4,"provider_rounds":4,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":29375},"model":{"requested_model":"coding","served_models":["qwen3.8:27b"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"60d0c608bdda6e13c46a9e6cbf4cd7cae4f7eea8d7fcd2d8a4f8f9bde415df7c","filesystem_tools_sha256":"1632a476feccd761a1c6d21c9d2962d0975632f50d6c96678d69427a7f973ed7","orchestration_actions_s